{
  "summary": "Added `stuckReported` boolean field to WatchdogTask interface to prevent duplicate logging of stuck task warnings. When a task exceeds its timeout, the warning is now only logged once instead of on every heartbeat cycle.",
  "learnings": [
    {
      "topic": "Watchdog/Daemon patterns",
      "reminder": "When adding state flags to prevent duplicate events in daemon loops, always initialize the flag in both the interface AND the task creation function"
